B.OS=s(["Whole numbers are 0, 1, 2, 3, and so on. They contain no fractional or decimal part and are never negative.","A digit\u2019s value depends on its position. In 93,132, the 9 represents 90,000 while the 3 represents 3,000.","Addition combines quantities. Subtraction finds a difference. A subtraction that would produce a negative result is outside this module and is introduced in Module 9."],t.s)
